# m4_identity: m2_play's input (the sweep with its two hold-B rewinds) and, since M7, m2_play's
# endless probe mode from 31 (a normal game no longer lives through stage 1 on this sweep; the
# probe charges each hit inside the World, so the identity check covers the power loss too);
# debug_history_check restores the world from the newest keyframe + input log and compares
# field by field: 0 = identical. 2090 and 3333 are during a hold (state 5, the world is a
# restored history state), 2095 and 3336 the first live ticks after a release (history
# invalidated after the resume point, then a checkpoint). The run also carries crates, a fork
# ghost (1866..2136), A beams (from 2208) and the retry shield (2365..2448): 2000, 2300,
# 2500, 3000 and 3700 check those; 870 and 2136 are probe hits (power loss), 2448 the shield.
# (Re-pinned for the mode paces with m2_play: until then the ghost ran 2010..2858, the beams
# from 2402 and the shield 2433..2684, with the probe hits pinned at 1022 and 2858.)
--frames 4000 --call-at "31 debug_probe" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_score,debug_world_size --at "300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "777 debug_history_check == 0" --at "870 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1022 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1500 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2090 debug_state == 5" --at "2090 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2095 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2136 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2241 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2448 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2500 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2684 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2858 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3333 debug_state == 5" --at "3333 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3336 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3700 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3999 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1"
